  "body": "Fork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\nAdds `site/content/guide/workflows.md`, linked from the guide index and first-run. Recipes: face the stock top, two-setup squaring, pocket and contour, drill and tap, chamfer/deburr, 3D rough and finish, lathe, sheet part (router tabs, plasma), re-post for another machine, tool library. Each step names UI labels grepped in `crates/ui` (and the guide pages for depth); sample part `testdata/models/Milling-test.step`.\n\nNot exercised: `zola` is not installed, so `zola check` was not run; steps were not driven in the app.\nLeft out: tool-library import from another system and a router machine mode (not on main).\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #1263\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
